## Predictions (written before the run)
- mechanism works: arm loop: a wolf, cougar or dingo wave within ~500 ticks of the release with the prey still present; arm no_exclude: a wave of a random species; arm no_release: nothing while two or more prey stay held
- exclusion window too short or draw cadence longer: arm loop: nothing within 3,000 ticks, then a random species after the restore
- predators never drawn: arm loop: nothing in 3,000 ticks and a random species after restore, in every replicate, while E8 showed emu draws under the same exclusion

